# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# Git / IDE
.git
.gitignore
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Android / Gradle
**/mobile/**/build/
**/mobile/.gradle/

# Local env (never bake secrets into images)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Docs and tooling noise (optional; speeds docker build context)
**/*.md
.github/
